    "text": "By Dakota News Now staff ,\n12 hours ago SIOUX FALLS, S.D. (Dakota News Now) - The Sanford Sports Academy will be hosting a holiday-themed basketball camp for K-8 girls basketball players, featuring seven current USD and SDSU women’s basketball players. The camp, called “Holiday Hoops,” is set for December 29 at the Sanford Pentagon. Seven... Read full article\nRead in NewsBreak",
